{% set periods = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan', 'periods') %}
{% set minutes = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                           'planned_duration_minutes') | int(0) %}
{% set dates = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan', 'data_dates') %}
{% set export = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                           'expected_export_kwh') | float(0) %}
{% set battery_export = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                                   'planned_battery_export_kwh')
                                   | float(0) %}
{% set pv_export = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                              'natural_pv_export_kwh') | float(0) %}
{% set baseline_export = states(
     'sensor.hoymiles_rce_self_use_baseline_export') | float(0) %}
{% set battery_revenue = state_attr(
     'sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
     'planned_battery_revenue_pln') | float(0) %}
{% set pv_revenue = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                               'natural_pv_revenue_pln') | float(0) %}
{% set revenue = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                            'estimated_revenue_pln') | float(0) %}
{% set price_floor = states(
     'sensor.hoymiles_rce_automatic_price_floor') %}
{% set gain = states('sensor.hoymiles_rce_optimization_gain') %}
{% set preview = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                            'plan_is_preview') %}
{% set scope = state_attr('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan',
                          'planning_scope') %}
**Horizon:** {{ dates }}<br>
**Price-data scope:** {{ 'today and tomorrow'
   if scope == 'today_and_tomorrow'
   else 'today only — tomorrow will be added automatically' }}<br>
**Plan mode:** {{ 'preview — automatic discharge is disabled'
   if preview else 'active' }}<br>
**Automatic plan price floor:** {{ price_floor
   if price_floor not in ['unknown', 'unavailable'] else 'no export planned' }}
{{ 'PLN/kWh' if price_floor not in ['unknown', 'unavailable'] else '' }}<br>
**Optimization gain:** {{ gain
   if gain not in ['unknown', 'unavailable'] else '0' }} PLN<br>
**Most profitable periods selected by the optimizer:**<br>
{{ periods or 'No data available to build a plan.' }}

**Total plan:** {{ minutes // 60 }} h
{{ minutes % 60 }} min ({{ states('sensor.hoymiles_rce_discharge_plan') }}
30-minute blocks)<br>
**Planned controlled export from now:** {{ battery_export | round(2) }}
kWh → {{ battery_revenue | round(2) }} PLN<br>
**Forecast surplus if Self-Use remains active:**
{{ baseline_export | round(2) }} kWh<br>
**Unavoidable PV surplus remaining after optimization:**
{{ pv_export | round(2) }}
kWh → {{ pv_revenue | round(2) }} PLN<br>
**Total future export from now:** {{ export | round(2) }} kWh<br>
**Total future estimated revenue:** {{ revenue | round(2) }} PLN

Future-plan values do not include energy sold earlier
today. Realized export is split above into
RCE-controlled sales and natural surplus exported in Self-Use.

The automation returns to **Self-Use** after the selected
slot ends, the minimum SOC is reached, or the
switch is disabled. The export lockout excludes the configured hours.

# ⚡ Your installation is working for you
{% set revenue = states('sensor.hoymiles_rce_revenue_daily')
   | float(0) %}
{% set energy = states(
   'sensor.hoymiles_rce_grid_export_energy_daily') | float(0) %}
{% set average = revenue / energy if energy > 0 else 0 %}
**Today the grid received {{ energy | round(2) }} kWh**, and the calculated revenue at RCE prices is **{{ revenue | round(2) }} PLN**. The average achieved price is **{{ average | round(3) }} PLN/kWh**.
Every exported kilowatt-hour is settled at the price applicable at the time of export. Period meters retain data after Home Assistant restarts.

{% set periods = [
  ('Today', 'daily'),
  ('Week', 'weekly'),
  ('Month', 'monthly'),
  ('Year', 'yearly')
] %}
{% for label, period in periods %}
{% set revenue = states(
  'sensor.hoymiles_rce_revenue_' ~ period) | float(0) %}
{% set energy = states(
  'sensor.hoymiles_rce_grid_export_energy_' ~ period) | float(0) %}
{% set average = revenue / energy if energy > 0 else 0 %}
- **{{ label }}:** **{{ average | round(3) }} PLN/kWh** ·
  {{ revenue | round(2) }} PLN · {{ energy | round(2) }} kWh
{% endfor %}
